    documentation? If you explored this part too, maybe you can add a separate
    section or document about the legacy build, soon we'll need it for another
    task.
- You mention the resolver ID translation tables can be optionally sourced from
    omnipath-utils: maybe, I'm not aware of this, can you double check?
- Can you please write a separate document focusing in detail on how the ID
    translation (resolver) and canonicalization of entities work in the current
    omnipath-build, compare the features and properties of this resolver vs.
    omnipath-utils, and include a brief evaluation of a potential migration
